      "sentence_id": 4,
      "text": "2.  The petitioner who is a victim of a sexual abuse and offence in Crime No. 556 of 2024 registered on June 07, 2024 punishable under Sections 376(2)(h), 376(2)(n), 323 of the Indian Penal Code,\n1860 read with Sections 3(2), 3(v), 3(1)(w)(ii) of the Scheduled Castes and Scheduled Tribes (Prevention of Atrocities) Act, 1989 has approached this Court seeking directions for constitution of the Medical Board for examination of her health with further directions to the Medical Authorities to perform medical termination of pregnancy pursuant to the Provisions of the Medical Termination of Pregnancy Act, 1971.",
