      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "4. We fail to understand as to what prompted the Chief Medical Officer to make such observations.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1730,
      "end": 1827,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "In this background, considering the nature of the prayer made, we cause notice to the respondents.\n5.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1828,
      "end": 1930,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "Learned Assistant Government Pleader Shri A.M. Kadukar waives service of notice for the respondent nos.2 and 3.\n6.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1931,
      "end": 2045,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "A.M. Kadukar",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 1973,
          "end": 1985
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "We direct the Dean of the respondent no.3-College before whom the petitioner had undertaken to appear tomorrow i.e. on June 14, 2024 at 10.00 am to constitute a Medical Board and submit a report in the Court at 10.00 am on June 18, 2024 in a sealed envelope.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2046,
      "end": 2304,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "June 14, 2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2165,
          "end": 2178
        },
        {
          "text": "June 18, 2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2269,
          "end": 2282
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "We would also like to have the affidavit of the Dean of the respondent no.3-College on the issue as to what prompted the Chief Medical Officer to refer the petitioner to the High Court, particularly having regard to the provisions of the Act of 1971 and the Standard Operating Procedure framed by the State Government.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2305,
      "end": 2623,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
